  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "模板方法收口",
      "items": [
        "getItemCount / getItemViewType / onCreateViewHolder / onBindViewHolder 均为 final override，子类只能实现 protected 版本",
        "空状态由 StateLayoutVH 占一个 item，与内容共用同一个 Adapter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "职责拆分",
      "items": [
        "4.x 把加载更多拆到 LoadStateAdapter 家族，靠 ConcatAdapter 拼在首尾，BaseQuickAdapter 不再感知分页",
        "拖拽/侧滑交给 ItemTouchHelper.Callback，多布局交给 addItemType 的监听表"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Diff 与动画",
      "items": [
        "构造传入 DiffUtil.ItemCallback 即启用 AsyncListDiffer，submitList 走异步 diff",
        "runAnimator 用 mLastPosition 做水位线，只给新出现的 position 放入场动画"
      ]
    }
  ]
}